  "releaseNotes": "Breaking:\n- changed pitch detection to accept an expected pitch vector instead of scalar\n        \nNon-breaking:\n- fixed hanning window being calculated incorrectly during waveform smoothing for pitch detection\n- adjusted slope of smoothing function used during pitch detection\n- fixed contrast value used during pitch detection getting calculated incorrectly\n- removed consistency criterion used during pitch detection\n- added window splitting to smoothing function used during voiced-unvoiced separation\n- tuned various parameters related to voiced-unvoiced separation\n- rolled back test adjustments, making the tests stricter again",
